        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "THE SITUATION"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "A kebab restaurant group with several locations, a loyal following and an online ordering channel owned by delivery apps."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Thirty percent of every delivery order went to the apps. The group's own ordering site was hard to find, and its social pages posted offers nobody saw."
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT WE CHANGED"
        },
        {
          "type": "ol",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Weekly food photography and short video, shot in the kitchens",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Meta campaigns by location, radius-targeted, with the offer in the first frame",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "A direct ordering landing page with a first-order discount",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Retargeting to anyone who had ordered through the apps and visited the site",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Festival and match-day campaigns planned a month ahead",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT HAPPENED"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Direct online orders grew 86% in five months at a 6.3x return on ad spend, taking a chunk of volume back from the aggregators."
        }
      ]
    },
